 class=3D"">Your instinct toward neural networks is common among ML practit=
ioners, but the security industry moved toward </span><strong><span class=
=3D"">robustness, explainability, and low false positives</span></strong><s=
pan class=3D""> =E2=80=94 all strengths of classical ML.</span></p><p class=
=3D"ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class=3D"">Bottom line:</span></st=
rong><span class=3D""> Build with Random Forest. Master behavioral feature =
engineering. Add deep learning later only for specific unsolved problems. T=
his is literally what the enterprise vendors do.</span></p><p class=3D"ds-m=
